PyCOL Optimized
Copyright 2026 Muhammad Syafiq Mohd Pozi

This package provides independent float32 PyTorch implementations of selected
data-complexity metrics and an optional compatibility adapter for the PyCOL
scientific reference.

PyCOL (Python Class Overlap Library) is a separate MIT-licensed project:
https://github.com/DiogoApostolo/pycol

PyCOL source code is not bundled in this distribution. Installing the optional
`reference` extra installs the separately distributed
`pycol-complexity==1.0.4` package. PyCOL Optimized is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the PyCOL maintainers.
